### 1. Root & Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/

### 2. Demo Event Loop & Non-blocking I/O
GET http://localhost:3000/api/event-loop-demo

### 3. Lấy tất cả tasks
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks

### 4. Lọc tasks đã hoàn thành (done=true)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks?done=true

### 5. Lọc tasks chưa hoàn thành (done=false)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks?done=false

### 6. Tìm kiếm task theo từ khóa
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks?search=Express

### 7. Lấy chi tiết 1 task theo ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/1

### 8. Tạo task mới
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Thực hành thiết kế REST API chuẩn vào ngày 23/9"
}

### 9. Cập nhật task (đánh dấu hoàn thành)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Tạo REST API Task Manager với TypeScript (Đã xong)",
  "done": true
}

### 10. Xóa task theo ID
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/2

### 11. Test Protected Route - Không có Token (Kỳ vọng 401)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/stats

### 12. Test Protected Route - Token hợp lệ (Kỳ vọng 200)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer secret-token-123

### 13. Test Error Handling Middleware (Kỳ vọng 500)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/simulate-error

### 14. Test 404 Route Not Found (Kỳ vọng 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/unknown-endpoint
